---
description: Suggest Fork only for a meaningful product choice
alwaysApply: true
---

Consult `AGENTS.md` and `decisions/` before clarifying how show discovery should work.

Suggest Fork when seeing working alternatives would help a meaningful product decision. For a cheap, reversible choice, choose a simple default and explain it.

Fork is not required for every interface detail. Do not treat agent walkthroughs as customer preference, conversion evidence, or a reason to ship on their own.
